{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y的感受描写明显削弱了X的细腻层次，尤其是与具体乐句、声部变化、音色和身体反应同步的提示，少了一些音乐正在如何推动情绪的具体体验。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y的左右分栏更容易形成稳定的扫读路径，叙述也把人物的动作、顾虑和心理转折连成了完整因果，尤其让人明白他为什么从小心试探走向坦白，又为什么在欢喜中仍然害怕失去。X的短句、高亮关键词和按音乐节点出现的感受提示，在抓取关键瞬间和呈现细腻音乐感受方面更有优势，但感受碎片过密，有时会让观众忙于接收局部意象，而忽略人物关系的整体推进。综合来看，Y更容易让没读过原文的普通观众在听音乐的同时理解这段经历；X则在音乐感受的精细度上胜出。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "af5bf1fa-f4ed-4915-b1c6-259a1a72f1b2", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T123608342181Z", "elapsed_seconds": 89.156, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T12:37:37.511946+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "38d94fa6662154469653a5f2ff0df3b2f685c588d5224aca02ba1e47eb86d3c9", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc